---
import { CONTACT, SITE } from "@/config/site";
---

<section class="py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-base-900 via-base-950 to-accent-950 p-10 md:p-16 text-white shadow-2xl border border-white/10" data-aos="zoom-in">
      
      <!-- Decorative background blur -->
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 -right-24 size-96 rounded-full bg-accent-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 size-96 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>

      <div class="relative max-w-2xl">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold backdrop-blur text-emerald-300 border border-white/10">
          <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          Offert sans engagement · Durée 30 minutes
        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight">
          Passez à la vitesse supérieure avec un expert Zoho local.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-base-300 leading-relaxed">
          Échangez directement avec Jean-Christophe Hutin sur vos besoins en Guadeloupe, Martinique, Guyane ou Saint-Martin. Obtenez une feuille de route claire et une estimation précise du ROI pour votre entreprise.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-accent-400 transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Réserver mon diagnostic 30 min offert</span>
            <span class="ml-2">→</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href={`tel:${CONTACT.phoneE164}`}
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-5 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-white backdrop-blur hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Appeler le {CONTACT.phoneDisplay}</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-base-400">
          <span>✓ Zéro engagement commercial</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>✓ Réponses adaptées à votre secteur</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>✓ Fuseau Caraïbes UTC-4</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

